      $type: "social.colibri.message",
      text: "@Guyren Howe: Because SQL is an abomination of a language designed by IBM and popularised by the CIA (https://frest.substack.com/p/how-the-cia-ruined-programming), while Datalog is concise and elegant.\n\nThe biggest single mistake in the computer industry (bigger than null) was synonimising “relational” with “SQL”.\n\nThis meant we think the only use for relations is in heavyweight on-disk OLAP databases. In fact, the relational model is more or less the canonical theory of “declarative” and should be used pervasively in programming. Our programs should be in significant part Datalog, with Turing Complete and side-effecting code inserted wherever that is necessary.",
